WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:04.350
Bettie Page was arguably the most popular
supermodel of the 20th Century, and she would

00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:07.620
go down in history as “The Queen of Pinup”.

00:00:07.620 --> 00:00:11.480
Even if you haven’t heard of her yet, once
you know who she is, you will begin to see

00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:16.330
her influence practically everywhere you go
in the United States.

00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:21.380
Images inspired by her still show up in music
videos, movies, and pop culture to this very

00:00:21.380 --> 00:00:22.380
day.

00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:26.910
Even if you recognize her face, very few people
know the story of her real life.

00:00:26.910 --> 00:00:32.150
This woman never used her circumstances as
an excuse for failure, and the amount of grit

00:00:32.150 --> 00:00:37.810
she needed to overcome obstacles to achieve
her dreams is astounding.

00:00:37.810 --> 00:00:45.520
This is the inspirational true story of Bettie
Page.

00:00:45.520 --> 00:00:58.300
Early Life
Bettie Mae Page was born on April 22, 1923

00:00:58.300 --> 00:00:59.780
in Nashville, Tennessee.

00:00:59.780 --> 00:01:04.270
She was the second of six children, and the
oldest daughter of Roy and Edna Page.

00:01:04.270 --> 00:01:08.400
Her father was an auto mechanic, but he was
an alcoholic who had trouble holding down

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:09.400
a job.

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:13.540
Her mother was a housewife, and those six
kids kept her extremely busy.

00:01:13.540 --> 00:01:17.031
During the Great Depression, Roy moved the
family around from place to place, because

00:01:17.031 --> 00:01:18.280
he could never keep a job.

00:01:18.280 --> 00:01:22.910
He was inflicting every form of abuse on his
wife and daughters, and he often cheated on

00:01:22.910 --> 00:01:23.910
Edna, as well.

00:01:23.910 --> 00:01:27.200
When Bettie was 10 years old, her mother finally
found the strength to get a divorce.

00:01:27.200 --> 00:01:32.020
Edna Page had to work full-time, even though
a few of her kids were still toddlers and

00:01:32.020 --> 00:01:33.020
babies.

00:01:33.020 --> 00:01:36.990
Since she did not have much education, she
could only find very low-paying jobs.

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:40.790
As the oldest daughter, all of the usual domestic
responsibility fell on Bettie.

00:01:40.790 --> 00:01:45.740
She was still only 10, but became the surrogate
mother of her younger siblings by cooking,

00:01:45.740 --> 00:01:46.950
cleaning, and babysitting.

00:01:46.950 --> 00:01:50.700
She did all of this cheerfully and with a
smile on her face, though.

00:01:50.700 --> 00:01:54.050
And their house became very popular, because
after school, the neighborhood kids could

00:01:54.050 --> 00:01:57.800
come over to their house and play together
without any adult supervision.

00:01:57.800 --> 00:02:02.430
Bettie loved watching movies, and they were
her escape from her harsh reality.

00:02:02.430 --> 00:02:07.100
They inspired her to sing and dance in the
backyard on a makeshift stage the kids made

00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:09.310
out of discarded scraps of wood.

00:02:09.310 --> 00:02:13.150
Since this was during the Great Depression,
the kids did not have many toys to play with,

00:02:13.150 --> 00:02:16.370
but they were entertained by Bettie’s imagination.

00:02:16.370 --> 00:02:20.310
Since she had an audience who eagerly awaited
to see what she would do next, she was always

00:02:20.310 --> 00:02:23.440
pushing the envelope and thinking about her
next performance.

00:02:23.440 --> 00:02:26.900
But those dreams would come to a screeching
halt.

00:02:26.900 --> 00:02:31.380
Even with Bettie’s help, six children was
far too much responsibility for Edna to manage

00:02:31.380 --> 00:02:32.380
alone.

00:02:32.380 --> 00:02:35.819
Even though she worked full-time, the amount
of money she made was simply not enough.

00:02:35.819 --> 00:02:40.340
Roy was not sending her any form of child
support, and they never heard from him again.

00:02:40.340 --> 00:02:45.020
It was so bad, that Edna had to choose between
starvation, or giving up a few of her children

00:02:45.020 --> 00:02:46.130
to live in an orphanage.

00:02:46.130 --> 00:02:50.040
Bettie and her younger sister were together
in an all-girls home, and she encouraged her

00:02:50.040 --> 00:02:53.290
sister to pretend that they were like characters
in a movie.

00:02:53.290 --> 00:02:58.300
By playing pretend, it helped her and her
sister stay strong and resilient through this

00:02:58.300 --> 00:03:00.110
traumatic experience.

00:03:00.110 --> 00:03:07.830
High School and College Years
After a few years, Bettie’s mother had saved

00:03:07.830 --> 00:03:10.970
up enough money, and was able to get custody
of her children again.

00:03:10.970 --> 00:03:15.210
Bettie was a few years older now, and she
had grown into a very beautiful young lady.

00:03:15.210 --> 00:03:18.849
Edna was concerned that Bettie might make
the same mistake she did, and give up her

00:03:18.849 --> 00:03:21.540
future by marrying the first guy who came
along.

00:03:21.540 --> 00:03:25.040
So, she made it a rule that Bettie was not
allowed to have a boyfriend.

00:03:25.040 --> 00:03:28.590
But, like most teenagers, Bettie rebelled
in High School.

00:03:28.590 --> 00:03:32.700
She fell for Billy Neal, the all-star quarterback
from the rival high school.

00:03:32.700 --> 00:03:36.100
He was everything you would imagine of the
stereotypical cool kid back then.

00:03:36.100 --> 00:03:42.730
He wore leather jackets, rode a motorcycle
to school, and probably skipped class to smoke

00:03:42.730 --> 00:03:44.870
cigarettes.

00:03:44.870 --> 00:03:49.390
Bettie fell in love with Billy, but the years
spent in the orphanage were more than enough

00:03:49.390 --> 00:03:54.760
for her to know that she never wanted to depend
on a man for her financial security, as her

00:03:54.760 --> 00:03:55.760
mother did.

00:03:55.760 --> 00:03:59.750
She wanted to get a college education so that
she could always support herself if she needed

00:03:59.750 --> 00:04:00.750
to.

00:04:00.750 --> 00:04:05.590
Keep in mind that in 1940, over 50% of the
US population dropped out of school after

00:04:05.590 --> 00:04:06.800
the 8th grade.

00:04:06.800 --> 00:04:10.400
Very few women ever went on to earn a High
School diploma or even attempt to earn a college

00:04:10.400 --> 00:04:12.180
degree, let alone graduate with a BA.

00:04:12.180 --> 00:04:15.340
If they did, they usually came from well-to-do
families in the upper class.

00:04:15.340 --> 00:04:19.129
But Bettie wasn’t going to let her family
history stop her.

00:04:19.129 --> 00:04:22.819
After school, Bettie joined the debate team
and school theatrical productions.

00:04:22.819 --> 00:04:26.330
She studied extremely hard, and graduated
second in her class.

00:04:26.330 --> 00:04:30.110
This allowed her to win a full academic scholarship
to Peabody Teachers College.

00:04:30.110 --> 00:04:32.849
She also got married to Billy Neal.

00:04:32.849 --> 00:04:37.150
Even though she still dreamed of being a Hollywood
starlet, Billy wanted them to have a life

00:04:37.150 --> 00:04:38.499
together in Nashville.

00:04:38.499 --> 00:04:42.659
She loved him so much, that she didn’t want
to break up with him to pursue her dream.

00:04:42.659 --> 00:04:46.749
The next best thing was becoming a teacher,
since she would be able to do public speaking,

00:04:46.749 --> 00:04:48.990
and share her knowledge with younger kids.

00:04:48.990 --> 00:04:53.319
So, after getting her Bachelor’s Degree,
Bettie started teaching at her old High School.

00:04:53.319 --> 00:04:56.960
Her former principal and teachers remembered
how she excelled in academics.

00:04:56.960 --> 00:05:02.470
But she was still in her early 20’s, and
not all that far off in age from her students.

00:05:02.470 --> 00:05:06.719
She was so beautiful, that she became a target
of harassment by the young boys.

00:05:06.719 --> 00:05:11.520
The male students thought that with her perfect
hourglass curves, she was simply too distracting

00:05:11.520 --> 00:05:12.520
to be their teacher.

00:05:12.520 --> 00:05:15.969
No matter how intelligent she truly was on
the inside, hardly anyone could see past what

00:05:15.969 --> 00:05:17.419
she looked like on the outside.

00:05:17.419 --> 00:05:21.340
Because apparently, no one can take a female
teacher seriously unless she looks like Professor

00:05:21.340 --> 00:05:22.919
McGonagall.

00:05:22.919 --> 00:05:27.389
Billy Neal joined the army, and they stationed
him at a military base in San Francisco before

00:05:27.389 --> 00:05:28.490
going overseas.

00:05:28.490 --> 00:05:32.000
As his wife, Bettie had to quit her job as
a teacher, and she was very excited about

00:05:32.000 --> 00:05:33.110
moving to California.

00:05:33.110 --> 00:05:37.210
She took this opportunity to switch career
paths, and got a new job as a secretary.

00:05:37.210 --> 00:05:40.599
One of the men who visited her office said
that she was pretty enough to be in the movies,

00:05:40.599 --> 00:05:43.610
and he offered to help her get an audition
in Los Angeles.

00:05:43.610 --> 00:05:48.659
Bettie was excited, hoping that this was the
big break to become a movie star she had dreamed

00:05:48.659 --> 00:05:49.659
of her entire life.

00:05:49.659 --> 00:05:53.189
Bettie showed up for a screen test for 20th
Century Fox, but she hated the experience,

00:05:53.189 --> 00:05:57.650
because she was poked and prodded by the makeup,
hair, and costume departments to the point

00:05:57.650 --> 00:06:00.839
where she didn’t even recognize herself
when she looked in the mirror.

00:06:00.839 --> 00:06:04.689
They told her that if she wanted to make it,
she would have to change a lot of things about

00:06:04.689 --> 00:06:08.620
herself, like going blonde and doing her makeup
a different way.

00:06:08.620 --> 00:06:11.960
The man who helped her get the screen test
made a move on her, promising her fame and

00:06:11.960 --> 00:06:14.240
fortune in exchange for sleeping with him.

00:06:14.240 --> 00:06:16.110
But Bettie turned down his advances.

00:06:16.110 --> 00:06:20.520
The man threatened to ruin her reputation,
and promised that he would make sure no one

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:21.819
ever hired her in Hollywood.

00:06:21.819 --> 00:06:25.999
She still chose to stay faithful to her husband,
and walked away.

00:06:25.999 --> 00:06:27.939
But Bettie Page wasn’t alone.

00:06:27.939 --> 00:06:32.100
Today, we now know that the likes of Harvey
Weinstein and Bill Cosby made it a habit of

00:06:32.100 --> 00:06:37.199
preying on young actresses, and that this
was happening to women for decades before.

00:06:37.199 --> 00:06:40.899
Even though she had been completely faithful
to Billy, he was actually angry to come home

00:06:40.899 --> 00:06:44.300
to find out that she was pursuing her acting
career while he was gone.

00:06:44.300 --> 00:06:48.430
He wanted her to be satisfied with just being
a housewife, and he wanted to move back to

00:06:48.430 --> 00:06:49.430
Tennessee.

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:52.950
She realized that their ambitions in life
were completely different, and they simply

00:06:52.950 --> 00:06:56.990
were not compatible anymore.

00:06:56.990 --> 00:06:59.039
They decided to get a divorce.

00:06:59.039 --> 00:07:07.599
Life in the Big Apple
In 1947, at 24 years old, Bettie moved to

00:07:07.599 --> 00:07:10.900
New York City and began auditioning for plays,
movies, and commercials.

00:07:10.900 --> 00:07:14.310
Unfortunately, she ran into the same problems
that she had in Los Angeles.

00:07:14.310 --> 00:07:19.229
The men in charge wanted more than just her
talents in exchange for work, and she refused

00:07:19.229 --> 00:07:20.759
to change her moral compass.

00:07:20.759 --> 00:07:23.969
For three years, she worked as a secretary
in Manhattan.

00:07:23.969 --> 00:07:29.029
As the years slipped by, she was now considered
to be too old to start a career in show business.

00:07:29.029 --> 00:07:33.860
She had given up everything in order to be
an actress, and soon enough, it would be too

00:07:33.860 --> 00:07:34.860
late.

00:07:34.860 --> 00:07:38.479
One day, Bettie was walking along the beach
on Coney Island, when she noticed a man doing

00:07:38.479 --> 00:07:39.759
pushups on the beach.

00:07:39.759 --> 00:07:42.199
This was a police officer named Jerry Tibbs.

00:07:42.199 --> 00:07:46.199
He said that he was a professional photographer
on the side, and asked if she would be interested

00:07:46.199 --> 00:07:48.180
in being paid to model for him.

00:07:48.180 --> 00:07:51.599
After talking to him for a while longer, she
decided to say “yes”.

00:07:51.599 --> 00:07:54.800
When Tibbs asked her how old she was, she
pretended to be in her early 20’s, even

00:07:54.800 --> 00:07:57.770
though she was already a 27-year old divorcee.

00:07:57.770 --> 00:08:02.629
Nowadays, this line about being a “photographer”
who is inviting a young woman into his basement

00:08:02.629 --> 00:08:08.909
for pictures is used by a surprisingly large
number of serial killers and perverts.

00:08:08.909 --> 00:08:12.949
But thankfully for her, the photography sessions
went just as Tibbs said it would, and she

00:08:12.949 --> 00:08:15.300
was paid handsomely for her time.

00:08:15.300 --> 00:08:18.430
Many of her photos began showing up in girly
magazines around Harlem.

00:08:18.430 --> 00:08:23.099
Keep in mind that this was after World War
II, where photos of pinup girls had become

00:08:23.099 --> 00:08:24.150
incredibly popular.

00:08:24.150 --> 00:08:28.689
A lot of young women wanted to do their part
to help the troops, and even after the war,

00:08:28.689 --> 00:08:32.650
posing provocatively for pinup became a goal
for aspiring models.

00:08:32.650 --> 00:08:37.020
So Bettie Page was excited to be apart of
this, and she had such a good experience with

00:08:37.020 --> 00:08:40.940
with Jerry Tibbs, that he invited her to become
apart of a “Camera Club”.

00:08:40.940 --> 00:08:45.320
In the 1950’s, a Camera Club was where a
studio would bring in a group of models, and

00:08:45.320 --> 00:08:49.100
both amateur and professional photographers
would pay a fee to come and take pictures

00:08:49.100 --> 00:08:50.240
of beautiful women.

00:08:50.240 --> 00:08:53.850
Sometimes, men would show up with a camera
that was empty, because they just wanted an

00:08:53.850 --> 00:08:58.380
excuse to ogle beautiful women wearing lingerie
up close and personal.

00:08:58.380 --> 00:09:02.130
But Bettie Page wasn’t just good at modeling,
she was a genius.

00:09:02.130 --> 00:09:06.630
She needed very little direction from the
photographers, and knew how to strike a pose.

00:09:06.630 --> 00:09:10.160
Her face was always cheerful-looking, friendly,
and approachable.

00:09:10.160 --> 00:09:14.260
There was something about her that made men
feel that she was just the girl next door.

00:09:14.260 --> 00:09:17.700
Many of the camera men would often stop taking
pictures of the other girls and spend more

00:09:17.700 --> 00:09:21.310
time on her, because she was just that good
at her job.

00:09:21.310 --> 00:09:25.470
Soon enough, Bettie Page was raking in the
money, and she made far more than she ever

00:09:25.470 --> 00:09:26.910
had as a secretary.

00:09:26.910 --> 00:09:30.770
She saw this as a stepping stone to finally
make it in the movies.

00:09:30.770 --> 00:09:34.580
Today, it’s totally normal for the likes
of the Victoria’s Secret Angels to be on

00:09:34.580 --> 00:09:38.510
a strict diet and exercise regimen every single
day to keep themselves fit.

00:09:38.510 --> 00:09:42.440
But back then, models usually showed up to
have photos taken of their natural body.

00:09:42.440 --> 00:09:45.800
Bettie Page didn’t rely on her natural beauty
to get the job done.

00:09:45.800 --> 00:09:49.910
She worked out every day, watched her diet,
and even sewed new costumes that would look

00:09:49.910 --> 00:09:51.120
good on camera.

00:09:51.120 --> 00:09:55.500
She treated this very much like a business,
and everything she did during her career was

00:09:55.500 --> 00:09:59.460
setting the new standard for what models would
be expected to do in the future.

00:09:59.460 --> 00:10:04.370
She began receiving requests to do photoshoots
all over New York City, and eventually became

00:10:04.370 --> 00:10:05.370
a millionaire.

00:10:05.370 --> 00:10:09.461
Whenever tastes changed, photographers expected
Bettie Page to do things that were more and

00:10:09.461 --> 00:10:10.461
more risque.

00:10:10.461 --> 00:10:14.340
She would agree to do it, despite any previous
hesitations she may have had in the past.

00:10:14.340 --> 00:10:18.180
She knew that times were changing, and if
she wanted to keep her career and business

00:10:18.180 --> 00:10:21.050
going, she would have to begin posing in the
nude.

00:10:21.050 --> 00:10:25.640
If you think her willingness to pose nude
sounds kind of contradictory to the fact that

00:10:25.640 --> 00:10:29.540
she kept refusing to sleep with anyone to
get a job, she had this to say; “Being in

00:10:29.540 --> 00:10:33.050
the nude isn't a disgrace unless you're being
promiscuous about it.

00:10:33.050 --> 00:10:36.650
After all, when God created Adam and Eve,
they were stark naked.

00:10:36.650 --> 00:10:40.750
And in the Garden of Eden, God was probably
naked as a jaybird too!”

00:10:40.750 --> 00:10:44.890
So...she continued to pose naked, so long
as she thought it was at least tasteful.

00:10:44.890 --> 00:10:49.340
One day, the Camera Club decided to find a
secluded area in Upstate New York to have

00:10:49.340 --> 00:10:53.450
a nude photoshoot outside, where the models
were frolicking in the grass.

00:10:53.450 --> 00:10:58.090
It shouldn’t be surprising that the police
showed up and arrested the women and the photographers.

00:10:58.090 --> 00:11:02.570
They charged the men for “disturbing the
peace”, and the women with “indecent exposure”.

00:11:02.570 --> 00:11:06.510
Bettie actually yelled at the police officers,
saying that she refused to accept that charge,

00:11:06.510 --> 00:11:08.980
because she was not an “indecent” person.

00:11:08.980 --> 00:11:12.790
She demanded to have the same charge as the
men, and they finally gave in, changing it

00:11:12.790 --> 00:11:14.460
to “disturbing the peace.”

00:11:14.460 --> 00:11:18.900
Despite having to serve time in jail for her
nude photos, she still continued to do these

00:11:18.900 --> 00:11:19.940
photoshoots, anyway.

00:11:19.940 --> 00:11:23.960
During the peak of her popularity, Bettie
Page became “Miss January of 1955” in

00:11:23.960 --> 00:11:24.960
Playboy Magazine.

00:11:24.960 --> 00:11:29.480
Hugh Hefner once said that he slept with 11
out of 12 of the cover models of each Playboy

00:11:29.480 --> 00:11:33.340
issue, and Bettie Page would have been that
one exception who didn’t have to sleep with

00:11:33.340 --> 00:11:35.290
him in exchange for being published.

00:11:35.290 --> 00:11:39.260
He actually purchased her nude photos from
a female photographer and fellow model named

00:11:39.260 --> 00:11:40.500
Bunny Jaeger.

00:11:40.500 --> 00:11:45.370
Hefner respected Page immensely, saying that
she "...was a remarkable lady, an iconic figure

00:11:45.370 --> 00:11:51.320
in pop culture who influenced sexuality, taste
in fashion, someone who had a tremendous impact

00:11:51.320 --> 00:11:52.760
on our society."

00:11:52.760 --> 00:11:56.810
When the issue of Playboy came out, we can
only imagine how her former High School students

00:11:56.810 --> 00:12:00.930
must have felt when they opened up the pages
of Playboy and figured out that the teacher

00:12:00.930 --> 00:12:05.390
they once had a crush on now had a full spread
of her nudes in glossy print.

00:12:05.390 --> 00:12:08.490
For some, it was probably a dream come true.

00:12:08.490 --> 00:12:16.180
The Scandals and End of Her Career
Modeling was paying the bills, but Bettie

00:12:16.180 --> 00:12:20.120
Page still wanted to move in the direction
of being in the movies.

00:12:20.120 --> 00:12:24.440
Sibling business partners Paula and Irving
Klaw ran The Movie Star News Store, where

00:12:24.440 --> 00:12:26.850
they sold “beauty photography” of pinup
models.

00:12:26.850 --> 00:12:31.070
They also filmed short clips of Bettie dancing
in lingerie, and sold them to customers.

00:12:31.070 --> 00:12:34.590
She eventually starred in two movies called
Striporama, and Varietease.

00:12:34.590 --> 00:12:39.551
After work, Bettie was taking acting classes
and auditioning for plays on Broadway, without

00:12:39.551 --> 00:12:40.551
much luck.

00:12:40.551 --> 00:12:45.840
In 1955, a Senator named Estes Kefauver created
a subcommittee that was cracking down on comic

00:12:45.840 --> 00:12:49.940
books, pornography, and basically anything
else that could be considered sinful.

00:12:49.940 --> 00:12:54.930
The FBI detained Bettie Page and interrogated
her, asking if Irving and Paula Klaw were

00:12:54.930 --> 00:12:58.130
shooting pornographic movies at the Movie
Star News Store.

00:12:58.130 --> 00:13:02.250
Bettie protested, saying that the women were
never fully nude in these movies, and there

00:13:02.250 --> 00:13:03.910
were never any men in them, either.

00:13:03.910 --> 00:13:07.940
Bettie’s boss, Irving Klaw, was taken to
court before the Senate sub-committee.

00:13:07.940 --> 00:13:12.650
Even though he was not found guilty, the mere
suggestion that she was starring in porn ruined

00:13:12.650 --> 00:13:13.650
Bettie’s reputation.

00:13:13.650 --> 00:13:16.910
Her name was printed in newspapers all over
New York City.

00:13:16.910 --> 00:13:21.250
Bettie Page became the target of slut-shaming,
and men were yelling at her in the streets.

00:13:21.250 --> 00:13:24.190
A stalker began to send her letters threatening
to kill her.

00:13:24.190 --> 00:13:28.060
Since she had gotten to know the FBI agents
in New York City, she contacted them right

00:13:28.060 --> 00:13:29.060
away.

00:13:29.060 --> 00:13:31.880
They believed that the person who sent the
letters was a known serial killer.

00:13:31.880 --> 00:13:36.610
They set up a plan where they used Bettie
as bait to catch the murderer and only jumped

00:13:36.610 --> 00:13:38.180
in at the last minute to save her.

00:13:38.180 --> 00:13:41.320
It turns out that her stalker was a 16-year-old
boy.

00:13:41.320 --> 00:13:45.820
But all of this took a serious toll on Bettie’s
mental health, and it was all downhill from

00:13:45.820 --> 00:13:46.820
there.

00:13:46.820 --> 00:13:50.540
In 1957, The Irvings had to shut down the
Movie Star News Store, and Bettie Page was

00:13:50.540 --> 00:13:51.540
out of a job.

00:13:51.540 --> 00:13:55.370
She decided to stop working as a model, and
give up her dream of becoming an actress.

00:13:55.370 --> 00:13:57.730
She moved to Florida, and became a born-again
Christian.

00:13:57.730 --> 00:14:01.610
The church made her feel like a sinner, and
that she needed to repent.

00:14:01.610 --> 00:14:05.550
While in Florida, she began to attend Bible
college, and tried to be a Christian missionary

00:14:05.550 --> 00:14:06.730
overseas in the 1960’s.

00:14:06.730 --> 00:14:10.650
However, when they found out that she was
a divorcee, they rejected her, saying that

00:14:10.650 --> 00:14:13.040
she was too indecent to represent the church.

00:14:13.040 --> 00:14:16.620
She began taking graduate courses to earn
her Master’s Degree in hopes that maybe

00:14:16.620 --> 00:14:18.040
she could go back to being a teacher.

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:21.980
But her reputation followed her there, too,
and she dropped out.

00:14:21.980 --> 00:14:26.420
All along, her mental state continued to decline,
and by the 1970’s, she was beginning to

00:14:26.420 --> 00:14:28.029
suffer from schizophrenia.

00:14:28.029 --> 00:14:31.150
She had a nervous breakdown, and ended up
in a mental hospital.

00:14:31.150 --> 00:14:34.550
After receiving psychiatric treatment for
several years, she was released.

00:14:34.550 --> 00:14:38.770
During that time, she had to essentially be
deprogrammed, because the Church had brainwashed

00:14:38.770 --> 00:14:42.090
her into hating herself and her accomplishments.

00:14:42.090 --> 00:14:45.640
As time went on, there was a revival in interest
over Bettie Page.

00:14:45.640 --> 00:14:49.980
She had been the most photographed model of
the 20th century, and when she retired, she

00:14:49.980 --> 00:14:52.550
seemingly disappeared without explanation.

00:14:52.550 --> 00:14:57.270
People wanted to know what had happened to
her, and the mystery only added to the excitement.

00:14:57.270 --> 00:15:01.970
For 40 years, no one heard anything about
her life after modeling.

00:15:01.970 --> 00:15:05.720
In 1998, Playboy Magazine tracked her down,
and asked for an interview.

00:15:05.720 --> 00:15:09.610
They asked her if she ever felt ashamed of
her work while she was doing it, or if those

00:15:09.610 --> 00:15:12.690
feelings of guilt came after she began receiving
criticism from Estes Kefauver and the Senate

00:15:12.690 --> 00:15:13.690
sub-committee.

00:15:13.690 --> 00:15:14.710
She said, "I never thought it was shameful.

00:15:14.710 --> 00:15:15.870
I felt normal.

00:15:15.870 --> 00:15:20.110
It's just that it was much better than pounding
a typewriter eight hours a day, which gets

00:15:20.110 --> 00:15:21.390
monotonous."

00:15:21.390 --> 00:15:25.390
For the rest of her life, fans sent Bettie
Page letters telling her how much they loved

00:15:25.390 --> 00:15:30.110
and appreciated her bravery for paving the
way for so many other women, and she finally

00:15:30.110 --> 00:15:33.040
got the recognition and love she deserved.

00:15:33.040 --> 00:15:36.870
She died of a heart attack in 2008, at 85
years old.

00:15:36.870 --> 00:15:42.890
At the time of her death, she had a net worth
of $20 million.

00:15:42.890 --> 00:15:48.540
Cultural Inspiration
Even though it was considered to be very scandalous

00:15:48.540 --> 00:15:53.440
at the time, the sort of modeling Bettie Page
did is on-par with Victoria’s Secret and

00:15:53.440 --> 00:15:55.250
Calvin Klein ads of today.

00:15:55.250 --> 00:15:59.089
Near-nudity has become such a big part of
American culture, that some young women even

00:15:59.089 --> 00:16:02.650
put similar photos of themselves on Instagram
without any shame.

00:16:02.650 --> 00:16:06.610
Today, we would barely bat an eyelash at the
majority of Bettie Page’s photographs that

00:16:06.610 --> 00:16:11.850
were deemed to be so sinful and inappropriate.

00:16:11.850 --> 00:16:13.840
Without her, things just wouldn’t be the
same.

00:16:13.840 --> 00:16:18.610
Bettie Page’s iconic look became the inspiration
for a number of fictional characters, including

00:16:18.610 --> 00:16:21.130
Jenny Blake from a comic book called The Rocketeer.

00:16:21.130 --> 00:16:25.210
She also inspired the looks of celebrities
like Katy Perry, Madonna, and the modern-day

00:16:25.210 --> 00:16:27.980
burlesque dancer, Dita Von Teese.

00:16:27.980 --> 00:16:32.080
In modern times, most men may have moved on
to having crushes on other female celebrities,

00:16:32.080 --> 00:16:35.850
and the photos of Bettie Page may not seem
like anything special.

00:16:35.850 --> 00:16:39.850
Today, she is now actually more popular with
women, especially feminists.

00:16:39.850 --> 00:16:44.650
She was strong, smart, independent, and never
backed down on what she believed was right.

00:16:44.650 --> 00:16:48.400
Even if it took her years of heartache and
struggle, she was able to make it in the modeling

00:16:48.400 --> 00:16:50.779
industry on her own terms.

00:16:50.779 --> 00:16:53.930
Even after her death, her estate continues
to make tons of money.

00:16:53.930 --> 00:16:58.529
In 2017 alone, Bettie Page merchandise sold
for $7 million.

00:16:58.529 --> 00:17:21.909
Her memory will continue to live on as one
of the most iconic women in history.

